[node name="ApartmentBedroomWindow" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Window 2.6 x 2 m, 2 bay(s), opening 0.4..2.4 m above the floor. Origin on the room floor at the opening's center on the wall's center line; -Z is outside. GENERATED by tools/props/window.py from tools/props/windows/ (apartment_bedroom); edit the spec, not this file. Bay 1 is a tilt vent (grab its handle, 0..10 degrees, latches shut near closed; city noise while open). Panel on the east side: top button runs the shades (press again to stop, again to reverse), bottom button steps the smart glass tint (clear, half, dark)."

